CVE-2026-58012
CVE-2026-58013
CVE-2026-58014
CVE-2026-58015
CVE-2026-58016
# libharfbuzz0b: O(n^2) 增长 DoS — affected
CVE-2023-25193
# libuuid1: Integer Overflow/Wraparound — affected
CVE-2026-53615

# --- debian:bookworm-slim（Rust 模块镜像）---
